      "impact": "A consumer selecting one of these registered directories can load it because the pinned validator checks coordinate shape and dtype but not whether any vertex is valid. Downstream area, quad, interpolation, and geometry routines then receive an empty surface.",
      "caveat": "The files are syntactically valid TIFF/JSON. The observed condition is semantic emptiness, not file corruption. One identifier contains z_dbg, which may indicate a debug artifact; no intent is inferred. The PHerc0500P2 original counterpart is non-empty, establishing that the registered normalized artifact is empty while the registered original is not, but not why either registry entry exists or whether a production workflow uses it."
